[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5651139758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123454#issuecomment-5651139758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123454","id":5651139758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUNWMrg","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-13T04:28:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T04:31:12Z","body":"Couldn't repro. Tested on an Android 16 emulator.\nSend a video of the issue happening (NOTIFICATION_WM_GO_BACK_REQUEST emitted twice) on your device to re-open this report.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5651139758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5761482256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123454#issuecomment-5761482256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123454","id":5761482256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABV2k-EA","user":{"login":"nakzyu","id":59201980,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjAxOTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59201980?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu","html_url":"https://github.com/nakzyu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nakzyu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T13:43:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T13:43:34Z","body":"I can reproduce this on a physical device, and I think I know why it didn't reproduce on the emulator.\n\n**Device:** Samsung Galaxy A15 (SM-A155N), Android 16 (API 36), **3-button navigation** (`adb shell settings get secure navigation_mode` → `0`)\n**Godot:** 4.7.2.stable (official export templates), targetSdk 36 (template default)\n\nOne back press (`adb shell input keyevent 4`) delivers `NOTIFICATION_WM_GO_BACK_REQUEST` twice, ~1 ms apart. The handler only prints the tick:\n\n```\nI godot   : [back] go_back_request t=28571\nI godot   : [back] go_back_request t=28572\n```\n\nLooking at the source (4.7.2 and current `master`), there are two independent senders of the same window event:\n\n1. `platform/android/android_input_handler.cpp`, `process_key_event()`:\n   `if (p_physical_keycode == AKEYCODE_BACK && p_pressed) { dsa->send_window_event(WINDOW_EVENT_GO_BACK_REQUEST, true); }`\n2. `GodotActivity.kt` (added in #117653): `onBackPressedDispatcher.addCallback { godotFragment?.onBackPressed() }` → `Godot.onBackPressed()` → `GodotLib.back()` → `send_window_event(WINDOW_EVENT_GO_BACK_REQUEST)`.\n\nWith gesture navigation (the default on recent emulator images) no `KEYCODE_BACK` key event reaches the view, so presumably only path 2 fires, which would explain the \"couldn't repro\" on the emulator. With 3-button navigation (or a hardware back key) the key event still reaches the input handler, so both paths fire.\n\nCould this be reopened? On these devices a handler shaped like \"close the topmost panel, otherwise navigate back\" performs both steps on a single press.\n\n(Investigated with help from an AI coding assistant; the log above is from my own device.)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5761482256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5778225508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123454#issuecomment-5778225508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123454","id":5778225508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWGi5ZA","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T14:21:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T14:23:04Z","body":"> With 3-button navigation (or a hardware back key) the key event still reaches the input handler, so both paths fire.\n\nTried using the back button, still can't repro on my Android 16 emulator. \n\nRe-opening the issue though, I'll take a look on weekend and test with a physical Android 16 device.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5778225508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6118048137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123454#issuecomment-6118048137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123454","id":6118048137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbKoBiQ","user":{"login":"williamchange","id":830253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDI1Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/830253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange","html_url":"https://github.com/williamchange","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/williamchange/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T04:59:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T04:59:56Z","body":"Godot v4.8.dev7 - Android 16 (SDK 36 build OS3.0.307.0.WPJCNXM) - Single-window, 1 monitor (2447x1268 @ 120.00 Hz) - OpenGL ES 3 (Compatibility) - Mali-G720 MC8 - MT6899 (8 threads) - Android (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nCan reproduce this using the editor, only happens if navbar keys are used, full screen gesture is fine\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1de98e26-2242-4d90-ab08-de3eb22b9779\n\n[double-back.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33320542/double-back.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6118048137/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]